'''Alcatraz''' (アルカトラズ島, ''Arukatorazu Shima'', '''Alcatraz Island''') is the 17th sub-chapter of [[Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.6 Update|Version 2.2.6]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it is the 10th sub-chapter in the Stories of Legend and is available up to 3★ difficulty.

==Difficulty==
This sub-chapter can be very hard if you're unprepared, even more so than the last preceding sub-chapter, [[Low Tide Beach]]. The hardest stage is either [[Underground Base]] due to its many [[Le'boin]]s and lack of money to start with, or [[Cat Trial]] due to its [[One Horn]] spam. [[Villains Jungle]] and [[Prison Prairie]] can also be difficult, with [[R.Ost]] and several [[Shadow Boxer K]]s respectively.
{{LegendDiff|150|200|200}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces two new enemies:
*[[R.Ost]]: A pusher-type enemy similar to [[Bore]], but with no trait, longer range, more knockbacks and a chance to [[Critical Hit|Critical]].
*[[Dober P.D]]: A slow-moving, short-ranged enemy with high health, high damage and a chance of creating a [[Wave Attack]].

